        <!-- Section 6: Beginner Roadmap & Decision Branches -->
        <section id="beginner-roadmap" class="scroll-mt-24 space-y-5">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-text-title pb-2.5 border-b border-border-subtle">
            六、零基础安全入门路线图与四类突发情景处置决策
          </h2>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-text-body leading-relaxed">
            如果你刚接触这类网络工具，还没完全建立整套操作概念，请先记住一条核心秩序：<strong>不要先跑去百度或网盘搜免费客户端乱装</strong>。正确的四步路线是：1）阅读基础原理看清开源客户端与订阅服务的分离关系；2）从官方可信验证渠道（GitHub Release + SHA256 核验）备好桌面/手机软件；3）选一家支持第三方订阅且允许单月购买的服务按月试用 3 天验收晚高峰；4）做好 Rule 分流、AI 独立固定组与百元不限时热备。完整引导可看
            <a href="/guides/beginner-onboarding-roadmap/" class="text-brand-primary font-semibold hover:underline">零基础入门 4 步路线图</a>。
          </p>
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border-subtle bg-white p-5 space-y-3 text-sm text-text-body leading-relaxed">
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-text-title">不同起步阶段的安全配置组合参考与月度巡检习惯</h3>
            <p>
              <strong>第一档（单机轻度查资料 / 学生入门）：</strong>只装一套开源客户端（Clash Verge Rev 或手机 FlClash / Shadowrocket），购入支持月付的入门专线或百元级不限时包即可，切忌一次性花大几百元买多年套餐；每月 1 号花一分钟看一眼面板已用流量曲线，确认无异常陡增。
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong>第二档（开发者 / AI 生产力重度用户）：</strong>选择两家支持第三方订阅的不同底层线路机场形成「包月主力 + 百元不限时备用」双活结构，并通过 Clash Merge 覆写脚本锁定 AI 工具专用组与国内代码镜像直连规则；每次更换网络环境（例如从家庭宽带切入酒店或公司公共无线网）时确认关闭了 Allow LAN 开关，并且绝不把包含鉴权令牌的订阅 URL 贴入未知公网网页工具。
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong>第三档（家庭全设备覆盖 / 电视盒子与主机）：</strong>只有在具备 OpenWrt 旁路由运维排障能力、且确认服务商不锁专属客户端的前提下，才考虑使用 OpenClash、PassWall2 或 Nikki（OpenWrt 24.10+）；否则单台电脑临时共享局域网或各端单独装开源客户端，远比折腾崩掉全家网关更稳妥。若是遇到具体突发异常，按下方四类情景直接进入对应处置路线：
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            {RESOURCES_DECISION_BRANCHES.map((branch) => (
              <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border-subtle bg-white p-5 flex flex-col justify-between gap-4">
                <div class="space-y-2.5">
                  <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
                    <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[11px] font-semibold bg-brand-soft text-brand-primary border border-blue-200">
                      {branch.badge}
                    </span>
                  </div>
                  <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-text-title leading-snug">{branch.title}</h3>
                  <p class="text-xs text-text-body leading-relaxed">
                    <strong>触发条件：</strong>{branch.condition}
                  </p>
                  <p class="text-xs text-text-body leading-relaxed">
                    <strong>应对建议：</strong>{branch.recommendation}
                  </p>
                  <p class="text-xs text-amber-800 bg-amber-50/70 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl p-2.5 leading-relaxed">
                    <strong>千万别做：</strong>{branch.avoid}
                  </p>
                  <ol class="text-xs text-text-body space-y-1 list-decimal pl-4 leading-relaxed">
                    {branch.steps.map((s) => (
                      <li>{s}</li>
                    ))}
                  </ol>
                </div>
                <a
                  href={branch.href}
                  class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl bg-bg-surface border border-border-subtle text-xs font-semibold text-brand-primary hover:border-brand-primary transition-colors"
                >
                  {branch.ctaText} →
                </a>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 7: Action Guides & 7 Subtopics Navigation -->
        <section id="action-and-subtopics" class="scroll-mt-24 space-y-6">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-text-title pb-2.5 border-b border-border-subtle">
            七、专题行动指南卡片与 7 个二级子栏目导航
          </h2>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
            {RESOURCES_ACTION_CARDS.map((card) => (
              <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border-subtle bg-white p-5 flex flex-col justify-between gap-4 shadow-xs">
                <div class="space-y-2">
                  <span class="inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[11px] font-semibold bg-bg-surface text-text-muted border border-border-subtle">
                    {card.category}
                  </span>
                  <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-text-title leading-snug">{card.title}</h3>
                  <p class="text-xs text-text-body leading-relaxed">{card.summary}</p>
                  <p class="text-[11px] text-text-muted leading-relaxed">{card.scopeNote}</p>
                </div>
                <a
                  href={card.href}
                  class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-brand-primary text-white text-xs font-semibold hover:bg-brand-primary-hover transition-colors"
                >
                  {card.ctaLabel} →
                </a>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border-subtle bg-bg-surface p-5 space-y-4">
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-1">
              <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-text-title">资源与情报专题二级导航目录（共 {hub.subtopics.length} 个子栏目）</h3>
              <span class="text-xs text-text-muted">涵盖免费节点、跑路预警、FAQ、情报审计、节点检测、订阅问题与新手帮助</span>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
              {hub.subtopics.map((sub) => (
                <a
                  href={sub.href}
                  class="rounded-xl border border-border-subtle bg-white p-4 flex flex-col justify-between gap-2 hover:border-brand-primary transition-colors group"
                >
                  <div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
                      <span class="text-sm font-bold text-text-title group-hover:text-brand-primary transition-colors">
                        {sub.title}
                      </span>
                      <span class="text-[11px] text-text-muted shrink-0">{sub.clusters.length} 集群</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-text-muted mt-1 leading-relaxed">{sub.description}</p>
                  </div>
                  <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-brand-primary">进入子专题 →</span>
                </a>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 8: High-Value Boundary FAQs -->
        <section id="faq" class="scroll-mt-24 space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-text-title pb-2.5 border-b border-border-subtle">
            八、资源与情报高频边界问题 FAQ（9 问）
          </h2>
          <div class="space-y-3">
            {RESOURCES_HUB_FAQS.map((faq) => (
              <details class="group rounded-2xl border border-border-subtle bg-white p-4 sm:p-5">
                <summary class="font-semibold text-text-title cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between gap-3 list-none text-sm sm:text-base">
                  <span>{faq.question}</span>
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-text-muted shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5.23 7.21a.75.75 0 011.06.02L10 11.168l3.71-3.938a.75.75 0 111.08 1.04l-4.25 4.5a.75.75 0 01-1.08 0l-4.25-4.5a.75.75 0 01.02-1.06z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
                  </svg>
                </summary>
                <div class="mt-3 text-sm text-text-body leading-relaxed space-y-2">
                  <p>{faq.answer}</p>
                  {faq.anchorHref && faq.anchorLabel && (
                    <p>
                      <a href={faq.anchorHref} class="text-xs font-semibold text-brand-primary hover:underline">
                        对应章节：{faq.anchorLabel} ↑
                      </a>
                    </p>
                  )}
                </div>
              </details>
            ))}
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 9: Internal Clusters & Featured Articles -->
        <section id="related-clusters" class="scroll-mt-24 space-y-6" data-pagefind-ignore>
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-text-title pb-2.5 border-b border-border-subtle">
            九、站内风险情报、检测教程与新手百科集群导航
          </h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-text-body leading-relaxed">
            下面汇集了本专题所属的全部关键情报、测速解码、订阅排障与入门引导专文（共 {relevant.length} 篇专题内容可供深入查阅）：
          </p>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            {RESOURCES_INTERNAL_CLUSTER_LINKS.map((item) => (
              <a
                href={item.href}
                class="card-elevated p-4 flex flex-col justify-between gap-2 group"
              >
                <div>
                  <span class="inline-block px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[11px] font-medium bg-bg-surface text-text-muted border border-border-subtle mb-1.5">
                    {item.tag}
                  </span>
                  <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-text-title group-hover:text-brand-primary transition-colors">
                    {item.title}
                  </h3>
                  <p class="text-xs text-text-muted mt-1 leading-relaxed">{item.purpose}</p>
                </div>
                <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-brand-primary">阅读该页面 →</span>
              </a>
            ))}
          </div>

          {featured.length > 0 && (
            <div class="space-y-4 pt-2">
              <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-text-title">本专题精选核心实战篇</h3>
              <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                {featured.map((entry) => (
                  <ArticleCard
                    title={entry.data.title}
                    description={entry.data.description}
                    urlPath={entry.data.urlPath}
                    pageType={entry.data.pageType}
                    category={entry.data.category}
                    pubDate={entry.data.pubDate}
                    updatedDate={entry.data.updatedDate}
                    body={entry.body}
                  />
                ))}
              </div>
            </div>
          )}
        </section>
      </article>

      <!-- Desktop Sticky Sidebar TOC & Quick Tools -->
      <aside class="lg:col-span-4 space-y-6 lg:sticky lg:top-24 lg:max-h-[calc(100vh-7rem)] lg:overflow-y-auto lg:pr-1" data-pagefind-ignore>
        <TableOfContents headings={headings} />

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border-subtle bg-bg-surface p-5 space-y-3 text-xs">
          <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-text-title">风险核查与核心工具直达</h2>
          <p class="text-text-body leading-relaxed">
            遇到免费节点校验、数据透明审计或想对比可信服务方案时，可直接访问以下站内工具：
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
            <a
              href="/resources/free-nodes/"
              class="px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-brand-primary text-white font-semibold text-center hover:bg-brand-primary-hover transition-colors"
            >
              打开免费节点安全边界万字专著
            </a>
            <a
              href="/reviews/brand-data-transparency-audit/"
              class="px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white border border-border-subtle text-text-title font-semibold text-center hover:border-brand-primary transition-colors"
            >
              查看 32 家品牌资料透明度审计
            </a>
            <a
              href="/clash/"
              class="px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white border border-border-subtle text-text-title font-semibold text-center hover:border-brand-primary transition-colors"
            >
              获取官方开源 Clash 客户端教程
            </a>
            <a
              href="/brands/"
              class="px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white border border-border-subtle text-text-title font-semibold text-center hover:border-brand-primary transition-colors"
            >
              进入 32 家品牌筛选数据库（了解详情）
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
